## Interface: 120100, 16001
## Title: RealUI Skins
## Category: RealUI_Core
## Notes: Blizzard Interface Skin
## Author: Gethe, Hanshi
## Version: 4.0.2
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\RealUI\Media\Icon
## LoadOnDemand: 1
## RequiredDeps: RealUI
## OptionalDeps: LibItemUpgradeInfo-1.0, LibSharedMedia-3.0, Masque, RealUI_Dev, RealUI_AsianFonts
## SavedVariables: RealUI_SkinsDB

Libs\Libs.xml
# Aurora's skin manifest per flavor. Forever (1.60.x, game type "camelot")
# also matches this TOC, so the two are split with load directives instead
# of separate TOCs; the Exclude on the Forever line is for clients that do
# not know the camelot token and treat an unknown AllowLoadGameType as a
# match. Same recipe as Aurora_Mainline.toc.
Libs\Aurora_Mainline.xml [AllowLoadGameType standard]
Libs\Aurora_Forever.xml [AllowLoadGameType camelot][ExcludeLoadGameType standard, classic]

Misc.lua
Locale.lua
RealUI_Skins.lua

